--Description / Thinking process:
-- We need Wisconsin-specific 2018 data.  In this dataset, Wisconsin counties are recorded
-- as “<County Name>, WI”.  Therefore, instead of looking for the word “Wisconsin” we should
-- search for any text that ends with “, WI”.  Using ILIKE with the pattern '%, WI%' 
